note seed/node/code-main.om -- omnode-code, the coding workflow program:
note omnode-code INFER TOOL OMC ROOT WORK JDIR PORT VIEW OBJ [OBJ...]
note with 1..4 objectives "KIND,K,N,A,PATH,TASK", absolute paths and the
note operator view's port VIEW on 127.0.0.1 (0 for none; see
note seed/node/code.om and seed/node/view.om). One hour for the whole run.
fn main to int
ret cw_main 1 3600
end
